Package: egpd
Type: Package
Title: Extended Generalized Pareto Distribution GAMs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Touqeer", "Ahmad", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "touqeer.ahmad8960@gmail.com"),
    person("Simon", "Frost", role = c("aut"),
           email = "sdwfrost@gmail.com"))
Description: Fits Extended Generalized Pareto Distribution (EGPD), Discrete
    EGPD (DEGPD), and Zero-Inflated Discrete EGPD (ZIDEGPD) models within a
    GAM (Generalized Additive Model) framework, with additional support for
    continuous zero-inflated EGPD utilities, neural-Bayes multivariate EGPD
    extensions, and fitting via 'gamlss' and 'bamlss'. The fitting
    infrastructure is adapted from the 'evgam' package by Ben Youngman.
    P-value testing code is adapted from the 'mgcv' package by Simon Wood.
    Models 1-6 are supported for each distribution family: models 1-4 follow
    Naveau et al. (2016) <doi:10.1002/2015WR018552>, and models 5-6 use the
    truncated normal and truncated beta transformations of Ahmad and Arshad
    (2026) <doi:10.1080/02664763.2026.2634785>, which satisfy the conditions
    of Gamet and Jalbert (2022) <doi:10.1002/env.2744>. Discrete models follow
    Ahmad, Gaetan and Naveau (2025) <doi:10.1177/1471082X241266729>;
    zero-inflated models follow Ahmad and Arshad (2026) and Abbas, Ahmad and
    Ahmad (2025) <doi:10.1080/03610918.2025.2585398>. See also Ahmad and
    Hussain (2025) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2510.27365>.
